<title>NEW ZEALAND: Cedenco H1 loss narrows to NZ$0.94 mln.</title>
<headline>Cedenco H1 loss narrows to NZ$0.94 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				0.94 vs 1.38 loss</p>
<p>    Loss/share (cents)		   6.1 vs 9.0 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover				6.31 vs 11.08</p>
<p>    Operating loss			1.26 vs 1.84 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend				 nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Food processor Cedenco Foods Limited issued provisional half-year financial data on May 21 and at that time commented that an expected rebound in its results was being delayed as it implemented a new strategy.</p>
<p>--Wellington newsroom +64 4 471 4273</p>
</text>
